        "method": "Published author proof/core and local context fidelity screening",
        "note": "Read the full Theorem6.1 construction/proof and the strict-hyperbolic supporting geometry: compact-real-form Lorentzian Cartan slice, adjoint orbit/wall formulas, explicit simple-root rotations4.5-4.6, simplicial chamber construction5.1 and K/T-times-chamber quotient(4.4). The proof explicitly checks face equivalence, K-equivariance, stabilizer injectivity, strict-branch surjectivity and Weyl distance/codistance. Standard twin BN-pair/Coxeter and compact Cartan conjugacy facts are identified prior background. Physical page22 was rendered and viewed: the journal PDF is visibly clean despite obsolete duplicated text-layer fragments. Only the strictly hyperbolic branch is selected; null-boundary compactification and rank-two infinity-building variants are excluded."
